   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_3" text:outline-level="4"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc35983_4032426435"/>Storage Service<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc35983_4032426435"/></text:h>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_4" text:outline-level="5"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc35985_4032426435"/>SCU of the Storage SOP Classes<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc35985_4032426435"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="First_20_line_20_indent">As a Service Class User of the Storage Service Class, <text:span text:style-name="T228">Starviewer</text:span> uses the C-STORE-RQ message to request storage of DICOM objects by a remote SCP. See Section <text:bookmark-ref text:reference-format="chapter" text:ref-name="__RefHeading___Toc2434_1692806117">1.1</text:bookmark-ref>. <text:bookmark-ref text:reference-format="text" text:ref-name="__RefHeading___Toc2434_1692806117">Content and Transfer</text:bookmark-ref><text:s/>in the <text:bookmark-ref text:reference-format="text" text:ref-name="__RefHeading___Toc2432_1692806117">Overview</text:bookmark-ref><text:s/>for the list of supported SOP Classes.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="First_20_line_20_indent">For details regarding the content of SOP Instances that are created by the system, see Section <office:annotation office:name="__Annotation__35966_4032426435" loext:resolved="false">
     <dc:creator>Autoria desconeguda</dc:creator>
     <dc:date>2024-02-23T14:17:44.094204179</dc:date>
     <text:p text:style-name="P685"><text:span text:style-name="T229">TODO referència</text:span></text:p>
    </office:annotation>N.9<office:annotation-end office:name="__Annotation__35966_4032426435"/>, which describes the underlying IOD<office:annotation office:name="__Annotation__35967_4032426435" loext:resolved="false">
     <dc:creator>Autoria desconeguda</dc:creator>
     <dc:date>2024-02-23T14:18:29.436416857</dc:date>
     <text:p text:style-name="P685"><text:span text:style-name="T229">[Provide some details regarding the triggering of storage requests (e.g., automatically when an instance is stored, automatically when the study is closed, or initiated by the user).]</text:span></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="P685"><text:span text:style-name="T229"/></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="P685"><text:span text:style-name="T229">[Describe when and how your product divides sets of instances into multiple series and or studies and how these are ordered.]</text:span></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="P685"><text:span text:style-name="T229"/></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="P685"><text:span text:style-name="T229">[Describe the behavior of your product in the case of a C-STORE operation using a referenced pixel data Transfer Syntax such as JPIP Referenced Pixel Data Transfer Syntax. This includes the duration of validity of the reference.] </text:span></text:p>
    </office:annotation> of the supported SOP Classes.<office:annotation-end office:name="__Annotation__35967_4032426435"/></text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_5" text:outline-level="6"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc41059_4032426435"/><office:annotation office:name="__Annotation__40515_4032426435" loext:resolved="false">
     <dc:creator>Autoria desconeguda</dc:creator>
     <dc:date>2024-02-23T15:09:10.105404325</dc:date>
     <text:p text:style-name="P685"><text:span text:style-name="T229">Si podem recodificar abans d’enviar. Crec que no I per això poso N/A.</text:span></text:p>
    </office:annotation>Transcoding of Transfer Syntaxes – <text:span text:style-name="T228">N/A</text:span><office:annotation-end office:name="__Annotation__40515_4032426435"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc41059_4032426435"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P653">N/A</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_4" text:outline-level="5"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc41061_4032426435"/>SCP of the Storage SOP Classes<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc41061_4032426435"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="First_20_line_20_indent">As a Service Class Provider of the Storage Service Class, <text:span text:style-name="T228">Starviewer</text:span> receives the C-STORE-RQ message from remote SCUs. See Section <text:bookmark-ref text:reference-format="chapter" text:ref-name="__RefHeading___Toc2434_1692806117">1.1</text:bookmark-ref>. <text:bookmark-ref text:reference-format="text" text:ref-name="__RefHeading___Toc2434_1692806117">Content and Transfer</text:bookmark-ref><text:s/><text:bookmark-ref text:reference-format="text" text:ref-name="__RefHeading___Toc2432_1692806117">Overview</text:bookmark-ref><text:s/>for the list of supported SOP Classes.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="First_20_line_20_indent">Table <office:annotation office:name="__Annotation__40518_4032426435" loext:resolved="false">
     <dc:creator>Autoria desconeguda</dc:creator>
     <dc:date>2024-02-23T15:11:04.940240936</dc:date>
     <text:p text:style-name="P685"><text:span text:style-name="T229">TODO referència</text:span></text:p>
    </office:annotation>N.5-10<office:annotation-end office:name="__Annotation__40518_4032426435"/> defines the conformance levels of <text:span text:style-name="T228">Starviewer</text:span>.</text:p>
