   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_3" text:outline-level="4"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc41063_4032426435"/>Storage Commitment Service – <text:span text:style-name="T228">N/A</text:span><text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc41063_4032426435"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P653">N/A</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_3" text:outline-level="4"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc41065_4032426435"/><text:soft-page-break/><office:annotation office:name="__Annotation__40522_4032426435" loext:resolved="false">
     <dc:creator>Autoria desconeguda</dc:creator>
     <dc:date>2024-02-23T15:13:51.522324100</dc:date>
     <text:p text:style-name="P685"><text:span text:style-name="T229">Afegir les subsccions que calgui.</text:span></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="P685"><text:span text:style-name="T229"/></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="P685"><text:span text:style-name="T229">[The sections below define some of the most used Query Retrieve SOP Classes as examples, however, there are many more Query/Retrieve SOP Classes defined in DICOM PS 3.4. If your product supports any of these additional SOP Classes, add additional Sections for these SOP Classes for SCU and SCP using the structure as indicated for any of the SOP Classes below.]</text:span></text:p>
    </office:annotation>Query/Retrieve Service Class<office:annotation-end office:name="__Annotation__40522_4032426435"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc41065_4032426435"/></text:h>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_4" text:outline-level="5"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc41067_4032426435"/>SCU of the Study Root Q/R Information Model – FIND SOP Class<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc41067_4032426435"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="First_20_line_20_indent">As a Service Class User of the Study Root Q/R - Information Model - FIND SOP Class, <text:span text:style-name="T228">Starviewer</text:span> uses the C-FIND-RQ message and supports the Query Keys listed in Table <office:annotation office:name="__Annotation__40525_4032426435" loext:resolved="false">
     <dc:creator>Autoria desconeguda</dc:creator>
     <dc:date>2024-02-23T15:15:05.522295895</dc:date>
     <text:p text:style-name="P685"><text:span text:style-name="T229">TODO referència</text:span></text:p>
    </office:annotation>N.5-17<office:annotation-end office:name="__Annotation__40525_4032426435"/> for hierarchical queries.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P653"><office:annotation office:name="__Annotation__40526_4032426435" loext:resolved="false">
     <dc:creator>Autoria desconeguda</dc:creator>
     <dc:date>2024-02-23T15:15:37.366785774</dc:date>
     <text:p text:style-name="P685"><text:span text:style-name="T229">Pendent</text:span></text:p>
    </office:annotation>TODO more content and several other subsections<office:annotation-end office:name="__Annotation__40526_4032426435"/></text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_3" text:outline-level="4"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc41069_4032426435"/>Print Management Service<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc41069_4032426435"/></text:h>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_4" text:outline-level="5"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc41071_4032426435"/>SCU of the Basic Grayscale Print Management Meta SOP Class<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc41071_4032426435"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="First_20_line_20_indent">The Basic Grayscale Print Management Meta SOP Class is composed of the mandatory SOP Classes listed in Table <office:annotation office:name="__Annotation__40531_4032426435" loext:resolved="false">
     <dc:creator>Autoria desconeguda</dc:creator>
