   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_2" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc45042_4032426435"/><text:soft-page-break/>Media Services<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc45042_4032426435"/></text:h>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_3" text:outline-level="4"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc45044_4032426435"/>File Set Creator (FSC)<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc45044_4032426435"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="First_20_line_20_indent"><text:span text:style-name="T228">Starviewer</text:span> supports creating the Basic Directory IOD as a File Set Creator as defined in Section <office:annotation office:name="__Annotation__42207_4032426435" loext:resolved="false">
     <dc:creator>Autoria desconeguda</dc:creator>
     <dc:date>2024-02-23T15:52:42.796830128</dc:date>
     <text:p text:style-name="P685"><text:span text:style-name="T229">referència</text:span></text:p>
    </office:annotation>N.9.5<office:annotation-end office:name="__Annotation__42207_4032426435"/>.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="First_20_line_20_indent">For a list of supported Media Application Profiles, see Section <text:bookmark-ref text:reference-format="chapter" text:ref-name="__RefHeading___Toc12543_1692806117">1.4</text:bookmark-ref><text:s/>in the <text:bookmark-ref text:reference-format="text" text:ref-name="__RefHeading___Toc2432_1692806117">Overview</text:bookmark-ref>.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="First_20_line_20_indent"><office:annotation office:name="__Annotation__42208_4032426435" loext:resolved="false">
     <dc:creator>Autoria desconeguda</dc:creator>
     <dc:date>2024-02-23T15:53:42.649195881</dc:date>
     <text:p text:style-name="P685"><text:span text:style-name="T229">[Describe, how the File Set Creator is selecting the Media Application Profiles used for creating the Media.]</text:span></text:p>
    </office:annotation>For a list of supported SOP Classes, see Section <text:bookmark-ref text:reference-format="chapter" text:ref-name="__RefHeading___Toc2434_1692806117">1.1</text:bookmark-ref><text:s/>in the <text:bookmark-ref text:reference-format="text" text:ref-name="__RefHeading___Toc2432_1692806117">Overview</text:bookmark-ref>.<office:annotation-end office:name="__Annotation__42208_4032426435"/></text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_3" text:outline-level="4"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc45046_4032426435"/>File Set Reader (FSR)<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc45046_4032426435"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P655"><text:span text:style-name="T228">Starviewer</text:span> supports the Media Application Profiles listed in Section <text:bookmark-ref text:reference-format="chapter" text:ref-name="__RefHeading___Toc12543_1692806117">1.4</text:bookmark-ref><text:s/>in the <text:bookmark-ref text:reference-format="text" text:ref-name="__RefHeading___Toc2432_1692806117">Overview</text:bookmark-ref>.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P655"><office:annotation office:name="__Annotation__42213_4032426435" loext:resolved="false">
     <dc:creator>Autoria desconeguda</dc:creator>
     <dc:date>2024-02-23T15:54:40.447632717</dc:date>
     <text:p><text:span text:style-name="T229">[Provide requirements for display and processing of instances contained on the medium. This could either be done by referencing Section N.5.2.5.2 (as indicated below), if the same requirements apply, or by copying the tables from Section N.5.2.5.2 and filling them appropriately, if requirements for external media differ.]</text:span></text:p>
     <text:p><text:span text:style-name="T229">To display or process DICOM Instances contained on the Media, see Section N.5.2.5.2.</text:span></text:p>
    </office:annotation>For a list of supported SOP Classes, see Section <text:bookmark-ref text:reference-format="chapter" text:ref-name="__RefHeading___Toc2434_1692806117">1.1</text:bookmark-ref><text:s/>in the <text:bookmark-ref text:reference-format="text" text:ref-name="__RefHeading___Toc2432_1692806117">Overview</text:bookmark-ref>.<office:annotation-end office:name="__Annotation__42213_4032426435"/></text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_3" text:outline-level="4"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc45048_4032426435"/>File Set Updater (FSU) – <office:annotation office:name="__Annotation__42215_4032426435" loext:resolved="false">
     <dc:creator>Autoria desconeguda</dc:creator>
     <dc:date>2024-02-23T15:55:03.933792704</dc:date>
     <text:p text:style-name="P685"><text:span text:style-name="T229">Pendent d’assegurar</text:span></text:p>
    </office:annotation><text:span text:style-name="T228">N/A</text:span><office:annotation-end office:name="__Annotation__42215_4032426435"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc45048_4032426435"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P653">N/A</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_2" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc45050_4032426435"/>Real-Time Video Services – <text:span text:style-name="T228">N/A</text:span><text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc45050_4032426435"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P653">N/A</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_2" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc45052_4032426435"/>Cross Service Considerations – <office:annotation office:name="__Annotation__42804_4032426435" loext:resolved="false">
     <dc:creator>Autoria desconeguda</dc:creator>
     <dc:date>2024-02-23T15:57:19.289282098</dc:date>
     <text:p text:style-name="P685"><text:span text:style-name="T229">Pendent d’assegurar</text:span></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="P685"><text:span text:style-name="T229"/></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="P685"><text:span text:style-name="T229">This section describes interaction between the implementation of different DICOM Services in this product. Details internal to an individual service are addressed in previous Service Sections.</text:span></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="P685"><text:span text:style-name="T229">Note</text:span></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="P685"><text:span text:style-name="T229"/></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="P685"><text:span text:style-name="T229">Note: The DICOM Standard typically does not define cross-service requirements. Therefore, this section provides an implementation description and is not strictly required DICOM Conformance.</text:span></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="P685"><text:span text:style-name="T229"/></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="P685"><text:span text:style-name="T229">[Describe any cross-service interactions, e.g., the MPPS COMPLETED message is sent when the archiving of related Instances in the Study is finished. If there are no Cross Service Considerations remove the text above and mark the section as N/A.] </text:span></text:p>
    </office:annotation><text:span text:style-name="T228">N/A</text:span><office:annotation-end office:name="__Annotation__42804_4032426435"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc45052_4032426435"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P653">N/A</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_2" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc45054_4032426435"/>Specific Character Sets<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc45054_4032426435"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="First_20_line_20_indent">See Section <text:bookmark-ref text:reference-format="chapter" text:ref-name="__RefHeading___Toc89466_458067131">1.7</text:bookmark-ref><text:s/>for supported Values for Specific Character Set (0008,0005).</text:p>
