   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_2" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc45078_4032426435"/>Configuration of DICOM Web Services<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc45078_4032426435"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="First_20_line_20_indent">The tables in the following subsections show the configuration parameters required for DICOM Web Services.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="First_20_line_20_indent">To identify whether <text:span text:style-name="T228">Starviewer </text:span>is an origin server and / or a user agent, the following applies:</text:p>
   <text:list text:continue-numbering="true" text:style-name="List_20_1">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P660">Origin server: The (Secured) Local &lt;Transaction Name&gt; URL is present at the local configuration parameters.</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P660"><office:annotation office:name="__Annotation__42837_4032426435" loext:resolved="false">
       <dc:creator>Autoria desconeguda</dc:creator>
       <dc:date>2024-02-23T16:06:12.117256839</dc:date>
       <text:p text:style-name="P685"><text:span text:style-name="T229"><text:s/></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T229">[&quot;Local Configuration Parameters&quot; describes parameters for the product described in this DCS, whereas &quot;Remote Configuration Parameters&quot; describes the information needed for this product to interface with a remote system. Remove rows for any unsupported parameters] </text:span></text:p>
      </office:annotation>User agent: The (Secured) Remote &lt;Transaction Name&gt; URL is present at the Remote configuration parameters.<office:annotation-end office:name="__Annotation__42837_4032426435"/></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_3" text:outline-level="4"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc45080_4032426435"/>URI Web Service Configuration<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc45080_4032426435"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="First_20_line_20_indent">Table <office:annotation office:name="__Annotation__42840_4032426435" loext:resolved="false">
     <dc:creator>Autoria desconeguda</dc:creator>
     <dc:date>2024-02-23T16:06:31.433551709</dc:date>
     <text:p text:style-name="P685"><text:span text:style-name="T229">referència</text:span></text:p>
    </office:annotation>N.6-10<office:annotation-end office:name="__Annotation__42840_4032426435"/> lists the configuration parameters required for URI Web Service.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P653"><office:annotation office:name="__Annotation__42841_4032426435" loext:resolved="false">
     <dc:creator>Autoria desconeguda</dc:creator>
     <dc:date>2024-02-23T16:06:43.591445802</dc:date>
     <text:p text:style-name="P685"><text:span text:style-name="T229">pendent</text:span></text:p>
    </office:annotation>TODO table<office:annotation-end office:name="__Annotation__42841_4032426435"/></text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_3" text:outline-level="4"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc45082_4032426435"/>Studies Web Service Configuration<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc45082_4032426435"/></text:h>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_4" text:outline-level="5"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc45084_4032426435"/>Retrieve Transaction (WADO-RS) Configuration<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc45084_4032426435"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="First_20_line_20_indent">The Retrieve Transaction is also known as WADO-RS. Table <office:annotation office:name="__Annotation__42845_4032426435" loext:resolved="false">
