     <text:p text:style-name="P685"><text:span text:style-name="T229">referència</text:span></text:p>
    </office:annotation>N.8-1<office:annotation-end office:name="__Annotation__45903_4032426435"/> describes additional non-DICOM network protocols that are used by <text:span text:style-name="T228">Starviewer</text:span>.</text:p>
